WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.697
Henry and his friends said good-bye to Nathan and Nora, and then hurried down the street toward the Martins' house.

2
00:00:07.698 --> 00:00:12.423
On the way Henry explained how he'd realized that Marty was the thief.

3
00:00:12.424 --> 00:00:15.705
"It's the only possibility," he said.

4
00:00:15.706 --> 00:00:19.516
"We already proved that none of our other suspects did it.

5
00:00:19.517 --> 00:00:22.734
Besides it makes perfect sense."

6
00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:25.455
"It does?" Cole said.

7
00:00:25.456 --> 00:00:27.658
"Sure," Henry said.

8
00:00:27.659 --> 00:00:31.773
"Everyone else at the lemonade stand was distracted, remember?

9
00:00:31.774 --> 00:00:34.897
Those two teenage girls were giggling together."

10
00:00:34.898 --> 00:00:40.834
Maggie grinned. "They were probably planning their shopping trip to the drugstore!"

11
00:00:40.835 --> 00:00:43.877
"Probably," Henry agreed.

12
00:00:43.878 --> 00:00:48.840
"And Ryan was busy chugging his lemonade and doing tricks with his skateboard."

13
00:00:48.841 --> 00:00:53.043
"And I was talking to Nathan and Nora," Maggie remembered.

14
00:00:53.044 --> 00:00:58.260
"Even Mrs. Martin was distracted by her cell phone," Henry said.

15
00:00:58.261 --> 00:01:03.293
