16
00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:05.731
"And then what?" Cole asked.

17
00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:09.744
"Like Maggie said, there was too much money to hide in Nora's hands.

18
00:01:09.745 --> 00:01:12.207
And Marty's hands are even smaller."

19
00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:15.488
