20
00:01:15.489 --> 00:01:19.149
"He stuffed it in that toy suitcase he was holding."

21
00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:25.537
Maggie gasped. "Henry, you're a genius!" she shrieked.

22
00:01:25.538 --> 00:01:30.319
"It's the perfect hiding place! Why didn't I think of that?"

23
00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.323
"There was no reason to remember it," Henry pointed out. "Little

24
00:01:34.324 --> 00:01:37.116
kids always have toys, right?" "So

25
