didn't at first," Henry admitted. "But

27
00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:48.510
when Nora was talking about Marty, I started thinking about him. That's

28
00:01:48.511 --> 00:01:53.261
when I remembered the suitcase and realized what must have happened." They

29
