Martin smiled. "I just discovered Marty playing with all this cash. At

40
00:02:36.129 --> 00:02:43.128
first I couldn't imagine where it came from, but then I figured out what must have happened," she said. "Sorry,

41
00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:48.204
Maggie. Marty likes to grab everything these days. He

42
00:02:48.205 --> 00:02:51.882
must have grabbed your money while I wasn't looking." "We

43
